{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51471","headline":"读《汉武内传》 · 李郢","name":"读《汉武内传》","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云锦囊开得画图，岳神森耸耀灵躯。\n青真小童捧诀籙，紫府道士携琼苏。\n金鼎未成悲浊世，玉缄时捧望青都。\n一辞姥长昏醉，方朔留言尽记无。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李郢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51471.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51471","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}